{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02346","headline":"杂歌谣辞 临江王节士歌 · 李白","name":"杂歌谣辞 临江王节士歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"洞庭白波木叶稀，燕鸿始入吴云飞。\n吴云寒，燕鸿苦。\n风号沙宿潇湘浦，节士感秋泪如雨。\n白日当天心，照之可以事明主。\n壮士愤，雄风生。\n安得倚天劒，跨海斩长鲸。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02346.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02346","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}